{"pin":"BH02753","subcodes":[{"code":"BH02753","anchor":"","first_line":"Praise be unto God! Today the garden of inner meanings hath become manifest and with blossoms [3.5s]... ...O thou that bearest My Name! God grant that everyone may be graciously aided to honour the Huquq. The Huquq is exclusively assigned unto Him Who is the sovereign Truth… Glorified art Thou, O my compassionate Lord! I entreat Thee by the tumult of the ocean...","first_line_orig":"لله الحمد امروز حدیقه معانی ظاهر و باوراد ... باره امانت مرقوم داشتند از این خبر فرح لایحصی  ","language":"mixed","word_count":"8330","translations":[],"refs":[{"kind":"manuscript","code":"BLIB_Or15736.163ax","source":"BLIB_Or15736","locator":"163ax"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AMIN.025-026x","source":"AMIN","locator":"025-026x","url":"http://bluefin.live/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/ganjiniy-i-khususiy-i-haj-amin.pdf"},{"kind":"publication","code":"BRL_DA#220","source":"BRL_DA","locator":"220","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/463278228"},{"kind":"publication","code":"BRL_HUQUQP#021x","source":"BRL_HUQUQP","locator":"021x","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/683576450"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BPRY.288x","source":"BPRY","locator":"288x","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/541152434"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BRL_HUQUQ#021x","source":"BRL_HUQUQ","locator":"021x","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/135355879"},{"kind":"translation","code":"COC#1131x","source":"COC","locator":"1131x"}]},{"code":"BH02753ENT","anchor":"ent","translations":[{"language":"ru","lang_name":"Russian"},{"language":"es","lang_name":"Spanish"},{"language":"uk","lang_name":"Ukrainian"},{"language":"ar","lang_name":"Arabic"},{"language":"iba","lang_name":"Iban"},{"language":"hy","lang_name":"Armenian"},{"language":"pt","lang_name":"Portuguese"},{"language":"fr","lang_name":"French"},{"language":"ky","lang_name":"Kirghiz"},{"language":"pl","lang_name":"Polish"},{"language":"ca","lang_name":"Catalan"},{"language":"en","lang_name":"English"},{"language":"is","